# Source material for the 发展汉语 (fazhan) lesson pipeline: raw textbook
# OCR, build scripts, FLAT-package zips and AI-generated images used only
# to author lessons locally and import them via the admin UI upload flow.
# Nothing in the deployed app reads this directory at build or request
# time (lessons live in the database once imported), and it has grown
# past 160MB, which was tipping Vercel builds over their size limit and
# causing every deployment since early October to fail silently (site
# kept serving the last successful build). Keep it in git for our own
# reference, just don't ship it.
content/fazhan-packages
